# Copy to .env.local (site) / export in your shell (pipeline scripts).
# Never commit the real file - this repo is public.

# Optional. Powers the analyst agent's plain-language read
# (pipeline/analystAgent.ts) and the project-card content agent
# (pipeline/projectCardAgent.ts). Both work without it - the analyst
# agent falls back to a rule-based summary at zero API cost.
# Set a hard usage limit at platform.openai.com/settings/organization/limits
# BEFORE setting this in GitHub Actions secrets.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Powers cms-intelligence/providers/anthropic.ts - the
# healthcare intelligence project's Claude provider (see
# docs/cms-intelligence/). Preferred over OPENAI_API_KEY when both are
# set (cms-intelligence/providers/index.ts). Defaults to Haiku per
# CLAUDE.md's budget guardrail. Every agent that would use this degrades
# to a rule-based/no-LLM path when it's unset - never required to run.
# Set a hard spend cap at console.anthropic.com BEFORE setting this in
# GitHub Actions secrets - same discipline as OPENAI_API_KEY above.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
